// Placeholder for the Google Earth Engine OAuth credentials file.
//
// docker-compose.yml mounts ${EE_CREDENTIALS:-./docker/ee_credentials.placeholder}
// into the `insar` service at /home/mambauser/.config/earthengine/credentials, so
// non-GEE scripts run fine WITHOUT any GEE setup (this empty placeholder is mounted).
//
// To use fetch_chirps.py: run `earthengine authenticate` on the HOST (writes the real
// credentials to ~/.config/earthengine/credentials), then set EE_CREDENTIALS in .env to
// that host path so the real file is mounted instead. NEVER commit the real credentials.
